ormal, and write the final answer in terms of $u$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (x-100)^{7/4}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {u}^{7/4}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{{u}^{11/4}}{11/4}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{11}(x-100)^{11/4}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{11}\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{11}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{4}{11}\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{11}}+C] & =\\frac{4}{11}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{11}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{11}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(x-100)^{11/4}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{11}\\cdot \\frac{11}{4}(x-100)^{7/4}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x-100)+0 \\\\  & =(x-100)^{7/4}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{7}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533857 true] [17592186255988 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255989 13194139533857 true] [17592186255988 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255990 13194139533857 true] [17592186255988 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255991 13194139533857 true] [17592186255988 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255992 13194139533857 true] [17592186255988 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255993 13194139533857 true] [17592186255988 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533857 true] [17592186255988 1041 "selection" 13194139533857 true] [17592186255988 1104 #edb/ref 17592186255989 13194139533857 true] [17592186255988 1110 #uuid "afb0006f-3f23-56ee-88f7-28fbc4472d13" 13194139533857 true] [17592186255989 1034 "\\frac{4}{11}\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{11}}+C" 13194139533857 true] [17592186255989 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533857 true] [17592186255989 1111 #uuid "6974fcbd-fc66-5d4d-8798-2dc3ffbd4389" 13194139533857 true] [17592186255990 1034 "\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{11}}+C" 13194139533857 true] [17592186255990 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533857 true] [17592186255990 1111 #uuid "9c6e8082-7b80-51ac-9c78-f7c8cc246f61" 1319413953